GrenaluxMine_3F_Text_Enter::
    .string "It is silent here. No pickaxes,\n"
    .string "no lamps, no wind.\p"
    .string "The PENDANT is warm against\n"
    .string "your chest, as if it knew this\l"
    .string "place.$"

GrenaluxMine_3F_Text_Whisper::
    .string "…{PLAYER}…\p"
    .string "A voice, thin as dust, drifts out\n"
    .string "of the rock. It does not come\l"
    .string "from any direction.\p"
    .string "…remember…$"

GrenaluxMine_3F_Text_Glow::
    .string "The garnet veins in the wall flare\n"
    .string "one after another, like stars\l"
    .string "being lit by a hand you cannot see.\p"
    .string "Whatever sleeps ahead is awake.$"

GrenaluxMine_3F_Text_PendantGlows::
    .string "Your PENDANT glows warm and\n"
    .string "bright.\p"
    .string "The whole cavern begins to hum.\n"
    .string "The garnet answers it.$"

GrenaluxMine_3F_Text_Vision1::
    .string "A vision washes over you.\p"
    .string "Ten years ago, deep in this vein,\n"
    .string "the miners broke into a hollow.\p"
    .string "Something very old was sleeping\n"
    .string "there.$"

GrenaluxMine_3F_Text_Vision2::
    .string "It woke in terror. Its fear spilled\n"
    .string "out of the rock as light.\p"
    .string "That light was the AURA.\n"
    .string "It washed across the world.\p"
    .string "It rewrote the TYPES of every\n"
    .string "POKéMON it touched.$"

GrenaluxMine_3F_Text_Vision3::
    .string "The AURA was never a weapon.\n"
    .string "It was a cry for help.\p"
    .string "The stones of the ten towns are\n"
    .string "where that cry settled.\p"
    .string "Your PENDANT is the first of them.\n"
    .string "It did not choose to be taken.\n"
    .string "It chose YOU.$"

GrenaluxMine_3F_Text_MewAppears::
    .string "A small pink shape drifts out of\n"
    .string "the crystal.\p"
    .string "It is MEW, the oldest of all\n"
    .string "POKéMON.\p"
    .string "It looks at your PENDANT, squeaks,\n"
    .string "and bolts!$"

GrenaluxMine_3F_Text_MewGone::
    .string "MEW slipped through the rock and\n"
    .string "vanished.\p"
    .string "Far away, you faintly hear a truck\n"
    .string "engine near the docks of APATIA.$"
